= irritator news

== irritator v0.1.0 - 2020-xx-yy

* core: adds `single_server_queue`, a FIFO queue with one server (G/G/1,
  M/M/1/K) that follows the Lindley recurrence.
* core: a generator can multiply the values of its time source by its ta
  (`ta_source_scaled`), a factor then sets the rate of random arrivals.
* simulation_wrapper: the factors of the same link group take their values
  together, the groups stay combined in a cartesian product.
* simulation_wrapper: the `time-mean` criteria (exact mean of the raw
  samples) and the `none` normalization of the weighted sum.
* simulation_wrapper: R replications of each scenario on common random numbers,
  the criteria are their means; `time-mean` keeps no trajectory.
* test: the reliability campaign of the decisions of the DEVS-DAMA supervisor
  (IRRITATOR_DAMA_RELIABILITY_CSV).
* core: the `rate` port of `single_server_queue` changes the rate of the
  services not started.
* test: the DEVS-DAMA closed loop, an agent of HSM and wrappers driving a
  M/M/1 queue (doc/dama-closed-loop.md, IRRITATOR_DAMA_CLOSED_LOOP_CSV).
